{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"html-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"HTML Snippets","description":"A page skeleton, forms, tables, meta tags, and accessible components.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"HTML / XML","path":"snippets/html-xml.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/html-xml.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"HTML5 page\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"html5\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<!doctype html>\",\n      \"<html lang=\\\"${1:en}\\\">\",\n      \"<head>\",\n      \"\\t<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\",\n      \"\\t<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\">\",\n      \"\\t<title>${2:Title}</title>\",\n      \"</head>\",\n      \"<body>\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"</body>\",\n      \"</html>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A full page\"\n  },\n  \"Link stylesheet\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"link\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"${1:style.css}\\\">\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A stylesheet link\"\n  },\n  \"Script\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"script\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<script src=\\\"${1:app.js}\\\" defer></script>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A script tag\"\n  },\n  \"Meta description\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"meta\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"${1:Description}\\\">\",\n      \"<meta property=\\\"og:title\\\" content=\\\"${2:Title}\\\">\",\n      \"<meta property=\\\"og:image\\\" content=\\\"${3:/og.png}\\\">\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Description and Open Graph\"\n  },\n  \"Image\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"img\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<img src=\\\"${1:src}\\\" alt=\\\"${2:description}\\\" width=\\\"${3}\\\" height=\\\"${4}\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\">\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An image with alt text\"\n  },\n  \"Link\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"a\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<a href=\\\"${1:#}\\\">${2:text}</a>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A link\"\n  },\n  \"Button\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"btn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<button type=\\\"${1:button}\\\">${2:Label}</button>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A button\"\n  },\n  \"Form\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"form\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<form action=\\\"${1:/submit}\\\" method=\\\"${2:post}\\\">\",\n      \"\\t<label for=\\\"${3:name}\\\">${4:Name}</label>\",\n      \"\\t<input id=\\\"${3:name}\\\" name=\\\"${3:name}\\\" type=\\\"${5:text}\\\" required>\",\n      \"\\t<button type=\\\"submit\\\">${6:Send}</button>\",\n      \"</form>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A form\"\n  },\n  \"Table\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"table\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<table>\",\n      \"\\t<thead>\",\n      \"\\t\\t<tr><th>${1:Head}</th></tr>\",\n      \"\\t</thead>\",\n      \"\\t<tbody>\",\n      \"\\t\\t<tr><td>$0</td></tr>\",\n      \"\\t</tbody>\",\n      \"</table>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A table\"\n  },\n  \"List\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ul\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<ul>\",\n      \"\\t<li>$0</li>\",\n      \"</ul>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An unordered list\"\n  },\n  \"Nav\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nav\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<nav aria-label=\\\"${1:Main}\\\">\",\n      \"\\t<ul>\",\n      \"\\t\\t<li><a href=\\\"${2:/}\\\">${3:Home}</a></li>\",\n      \"\\t</ul>\",\n      \"</nav>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A navigation block\"\n  },\n  \"Details\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"details\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<details>\",\n      \"\\t<summary>${1:Question}</summary>\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"</details>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A disclosure widget\"\n  },\n  \"Dialog\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dialog\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<dialog id=\\\"${1:dialog}\\\">\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"\\t<form method=\\\"dialog\\\"><button>Close</button></form>\",\n      \"</dialog>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A dialog\"\n  },\n  \"Picture\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pic\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<picture>\",\n      \"\\t<source srcset=\\\"${1:image.webp}\\\" type=\\\"image/webp\\\">\",\n      \"\\t<img src=\\\"${2:image.jpg}\\\" alt=\\\"${3}\\\">\",\n      \"</picture>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A responsive picture\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# HTML Snippets\n\nA page skeleton, forms, tables, meta tags, and accessible components.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 14 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| HTML / XML | `html5` | A full page |\n| HTML / XML | `link` | A stylesheet link |\n| HTML / XML | `script` | A script tag |\n| HTML / XML | `meta` | Description and Open Graph |\n| HTML / XML | `img` | An image with alt text |\n| HTML / XML | `a` | A link |\n| HTML / XML | `btn` | A button |\n| HTML / XML | `form` | A form |\n| HTML / XML | `table` | A table |\n| HTML / XML | `ul` | An unordered list |\n| HTML / XML | `nav` | A navigation block |\n| HTML / XML | `details` | A disclosure widget |\n| HTML / XML | `dialog` | A dialog |\n| HTML / XML | `pic` | A responsive picture |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}